<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font style="font-size: 12pt;" face="arial">Dear&nbsp;{!Opportunity.OwnerFirstName},</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Your renewal opportunity for&nbsp;</span><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Opportunity.Name}</b><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;at the amount of {!Opportunity.Amount} is&nbsp;</span><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Opportunity.Days_until_next_renewal_due__c}</b><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;from renewal with a status of <b>{!Opportunity.Stage}</b></span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">. Please start the renewal conversation with your POC&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Primary_Client_Contact__c} and update the opportunity to reflect the status here:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><u>{!Opportunity.Link}</u></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">A reminder of the targeted&nbsp;<b>Stage</b>&nbsp;for the {!Opportunity.Days_until_next_renewal_due__c} days leading up to renewal:</div><div><ul><li>3 months&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Gather Client Feedback</li><li><font face="arial">2 1/2 months - Draft Renewal Documents</font></li><li><font face="arial">2 months&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Negotiations/Draft Contract Sent for Client Review</font></li><li><font face="arial">1 1/2 months - Contract Sent</font></li><li><font face="arial">1 month or less&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Contract Received/Change Opportunity to Win</font></li></ul></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Sales Ops</div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>